{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 34, :comments ["<b>Before it was leavened.</b> And so we find for the future, that the prophet said (Hosea 7:4): ״ישבות מעיר מלוש בצק עד חומצתו״." "<b>Their kneading bowls.</b> Leftover matzah and maror; and others say: leftovers of the paschal offerings, as it is said: ״ולא תותירו ממנו עד בקר״." "<b>On their shoulders.</b> They had many animals, for it is written ״מקנה כבד מאד״ — very heavy livestock; only they cherished the commandments."], :book :exodus, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:58:14.749835834Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}